Native PHP rMQR and MaxiCode implementation

Tables and layout/ECC procedures adapted from Zint (backend/qr.c, qr.h,
maxicode.c, maxicode.h, vector.c, reedsol.c), commit
9dd9791c43d6cde69d27e46f1c39874011aca4c3, https://github.com/zint/zint.
Primary standards identified by that implementation: ISO/IEC 23941:2022 (rMQR)
and ISO/IEC 16023:2000 (MaxiCode). Supported modes are documented separately;
no claim of an exhaustive implementation of either specification.

